## What's NOT in production yet (as of September 2, 2026)

**Infrastructure:**
- Rust adaptive service (built, not deployed; env var `SYNCSENTA_RUST_ADAPTIVE_URL` not set in Vercel)
- Distributed rate limiting via Upstash on all routes (only `/api/chat` has it)

**Features:**
- Parent portal (no pages built yet; demo account exists but has no UI)
- Real-time teacher WebSocket alerts (code exists in ai-agents, not fully wired to Studio)
- Multi-subject comparative analytics dashboard

**Integrations:**
- ESP32-CAM firmware (API contract mismatch with current FastAPI endpoints)
- Voice call orchestrator (contains placeholder AI method, not production-ready)

**Testing gaps:**
- Unit tests for `evaluateTutoringDecision()` (high priority)
- Unit tests for `buildDynamicSystemPrompt()` (high priority)
- Integration tests for Omega decision flow with mocked Supabase + Redis

